:: Bird Rescue No Syndrome
<<effects>>
<<if !$birdescaped>>
	당신은 당신의 구원자를 본다; 
	<<if $monster is 1>>
		발 대신 발톱을 가진 날개 달린 <<nnpc_gendery "Great Hawk">>.
	<<else>>
		거대한 매, 이렇게 가까이서 보니 훨씬 더 커 보인다.
	<</if>>
<<else>>
	<<beasttype>>【이가】 다가온다.
<</if>>
<<bHe>>【은는】 발톱을 편 채 당신을 향해 <<= $phase is 1 ? "뛰어든다" : "급강하한다">>. <<bhis>> 눈이 당신을 꿰뚫는다. <span class="red">공포가 당신을 그 자리에 얼어붙게 할 것 같다.</span>
<br><br>
<<if $stress gte $stressmax>>
	<span class="red">너무 벅차다.</span> 당신은 쓰러지고, 마지막으로 느껴지는 것은 <<beasttype>>의 발톱이 어깨를 감싸는 감촉이다.
	<br>
	<<link [[다음|Moor Bird Wake]]>><<passout>><<set $moor to 0>><<endevent>><<pass 30>><</link>>
	<br>
<<else>>
	<<if $pain gte 95>>
		<span class="red">너무 고통스러워서 움직일 수 없다.</span>
		<<set $phase to 0>>
		<br>
	<<elseif $trauma gte $traumamax>>
		<span class="red">움직일 수가 없다.</span><<ggstress>><<stress 24>>
		<<set $phase to 1>>
		<br>
	<<elseif $passoutReason>>
		<span class="red">너무 <<= $passoutReason is "hypothermia" ? "추워서" : "약해서">> 움직일 수 없다.</span><<ggstress>><<stress 24>>
		<<set $phase to 1>>
		<br>
	<<else>>
		<<link [[피한다|Bird Rescue No Syndrome Dodge]]>><<unset $phase>><</link>><<willpowerdifficulty `(1+(2*$pain))` `(300+(2*$pain))`>><<athleticsdifficulty `(200+(2*$pain))` `(400+(2*$pain))`>>
		<<set $phase to 2>>
		<br>
	<</if>>
	<<link "<<bhim>>【이가】 당신을 데려가게 둔다" "Bird Rescue No Syndrome Willing">><</link>>
	<br>
<</if>>

:: Bird Rescue No Syndrome Dodge
/* ============ 번역 필요 ============== */
<<effects>>

<<if $willpowerSuccess is 1>>
	<span class="green">You manage to tear your eyes away from the <<beasttype>>,</span>
	<<if $athleticsSuccess is 1>>
		<span class="green">and throw yourself to the side, evading <<bhis>> grasp.</span>
		<br>
		<<if random(1, 2) is 1>>
			<<bHe>> swoops past, and then circles back overhead, waiting for another chance.
			<br>
			<<set $moor_hunt to 5>>
			<<destinationMoor "next">><<endevent>><<set $eventskip to 1>><</destinationMoor>>
			<br>
		<<else>>
			<<bHis>> talons pierce the earth, and <<bhe>> flares out <<bhis>> wings to come to a halt. <<bHe>> <<if $monster is 1>>turns<<else>>hops<</if>> around to face you, flaring <<bhis>> wings.
			<br><br>
			<<link [[다음|Bird Rescue No Syndrome Fight]]>><<set $molestationstart to 1>><</link>>
			<br>
		<</if>>
	<<else>>
		<span class="red">but can't get out of the way fast enough.</span><<gathletics>><<athletics 4>>
		<br><br>

		The <<beasttype>> <<if $monster is 1>>grabs onto<<else>>slams into<</if>> your shoulder, and is sent crashing into the ground<<if $monster is 1>>, pulling you with <<bhim>><<pain 6>><<else>><<pain 4>><</if>>. <<gpain>>
		<br><br>

		<<bHe>> lets out a surprised squawk, before <<if $monster is 1>>climbing<<else>>fluttering<</if>> upright and locking eyes with you.
		<br><br>

		<<link [[다음|Bird Rescue No Syndrome Fight]]>><<set $molestationstart to 2>><</link>>
		<br>
	<</if>>
<<else>>
	<span class="red">You can't tear your eyes away from the <<beasttype>>,</span>
	<<if $athleticsSuccess is 1>>
		<span class="blue">even though your body tries to force itself out of the way.</span><<gwillpower>><<willpower 4>>
	<<else>>
		<span class="red">and you remain rooted to the spot, not even trying to move.</span><<gwillpower>><<willpower 3>>
	<</if>>
	<br><br>

	Grasping your shoulders with <<bhis>> talons, you're lifted into the air.
	<br><br>

	<<if $monster is 1>>
		<<if $birdescaped gte 1>>
			"<<Wife>> should be more careful," <<bhe>> says. <<if $harpy gte 6>>"<<Wife>> doesn't know how to fly yet."<<elseif $moor lte 20>>"I don't often fly this far from the nest."<</if>>
		<<else>>
			"Worry not, I never drop my catches," <<bhe>> says.
		<</if>>
		<br><br>
	<</if>>

	<<link [[다음|Bird Rescue No Syndrome Tower 1]]>><<set $phase to 3>><</link>>
	<br>
<</if>>

:: Bird Rescue No Syndrome Fight
<<if $molestationstart gte 1>>
	<<controlloss>>
	<<violence 1>>
	<<neutral 1>>
	<<molested>>
	<<beastCombatInit>>
	<<set $enemytrust -= 100>>
	<<set $enemyanger += 200>>
	<<set $enemyhealthmax to 600>>
	<<if $molestationstart is 2>>
