:: Bird Rescue No Syndrome Fight End
/* ============ 번역 필요 ============== */
<<effects>>
<<if $enemyarousal gte $enemyarousalmax>>
	<<beastejaculation>>

	Tired, the <<beasttype>> takes to the air. <span class="red"><<bHe>> circles overhead.</span>
	<<clotheson>>
	<<endcombat>>

	<<set $moor_hunt to 5>>
	<<tearful>> you continue on your journey.
	<br><br>

	<<destinationMoor "next">><<set $eventskip to 1>><</destinationMoor>>
	<br>
<<elseif $enemyhealth lte 0>>
	You stagger backwards as the <<beasttype>> beats <<bhis>> wings, and takes to the air. <<bHe>> swoops behind a hillock, and out of sight. <span class="green">You're in the clear.</span> For now.
	<<clotheson>>
	<<endcombat>>
	<<unset $moor_hunt>>
	<<tearful>> you continue your journey.
	<br><br>

	<<destinationMoor "next">><<set $eventskip to 1>><</destinationMoor>>
	<br>
<<else>>
	You fall to the ground, too hurt to keep fighting.
	<br><br>

	The <<beasttype>>'s talons curl around your shoulders, and the ground falls away from you as <<bhe>> lifts you into the air.
	<<if $monster is 1>>
		"<<if $birdescaped gte 1>><<Wife>> shouldn't run away! The moor is dangerous for landbound travellers<<else>>You have a fighting spirit. You've impressed me<</if>>," <<bhe>> says, nearly drowned out by the sound of <<bhis>> mighty wingbeats.
	<</if>>
	<<clotheson>>
	<<endcombat>>
	<<npc "Great Hawk">>

	<<link [[다음|Bird Rescue No Syndrome Tower 1]]>><<set $phase to 4>><</link>>
<</if>>

:: Bird Rescue No Syndrome Willing
당신은 <<bhe>>【이가】 <<bhis>> 발톱으로 당신의 어깨를 잡게 하고, <<bhe>>【은는】 당신을 하늘로 들어 올린다. 공중을 날아오르며,
<<if $harpy gte 6>>
	소속감을 느낀다.<<lstress>><<stress -4>>
<<elseif $stress gte ($stressmax / 5 ) * 3>>
	<span class="red">아래를 내려다보는 실수를 저지른다.</span>
	<<if $trauma gte $traumamax>>
		<span class="teal">여기 위에서는 세상이 너무 작아 보인다.</span><<ltrauma>><<trauma -6>>
	<</if>><<gstress>><<stress 6>>
<<else>>
	모든 것이 너무나 멀게 느껴진다.
<</if>>
<br><br>

<<if $monster is 1>>
	<<if $birdescaped gte 1>>
		"<<Wife>> 도망가면 안 돼," <<bhe>>【이가】 꾸짖는다. "<<if $harpy gte 6 and $birdFly isnot 1>>아직 <<Wife>> 혼자서는 날 수 없잖아.<<else>>둥지에 있는 게 더 안전해.<</if>>."
	<<else>>
		"떨어뜨리지 않을 거야," <<bhe>>【이가】 말한다. "믿어봐."
	<</if>>
	<br><br>
<</if>>

<<link [[다음|Bird Rescue No Syndrome Tower 1]]>><</link>>
