:: Bird Rescue No Syndrome Tower Hug
<<effects>>

<<if $phase is 0>>느껴지는 고통에도 불구하고, 당신은<<elseif $phase is 1>>비틀거리며, 당신은<<else>>당신은<</if>> <<beasttype>> 쪽으로 한 걸음 다가가 <<bhis>> <<if $monster is 1>>몸<<elseif currentSkillValue('tending') gte 400>>외투막<<else>>어깨 부근<</if>>에 팔을 두르고 <<bhim>>【을를】 꽉 껴안는다.
<<bHe>>【은는】 <<if $phase isnot 2 or $birdescaped gte 1>>【이가】 상황을 망설이는 듯하지만,<<else>>【이가】 상황에 만족하며<</if>> <<if $monster is 1>>포옹에 화답한다<<else>>당신에게 몸을 비빈다<</if>><<if $phase isnot 2 or $birdescaped gte 1>>. 잠시 후<</if>>
<br><br>

<<link [[놓아준다|Bird Rescue No Syndrome Tower Release]]>><</link>>
<br>
<<if $trauma gte ($traumamax / 7) * 4>>
	<<link [[무너져 내린다|Bird Rescue No Syndrome Tower Cry]]>><<stress -12>><<trauma -12>><<npcincr "Great Hawk" love 3>><<npcincr "Great Hawk" dom 3>><<bird_stockholm 3>><</link>><<llstress>><<lltrauma>><<gglove>><<ggdom>><<gggstockholm>>
	<br>
<</if>>

:: Bird Rescue No Syndrome Tower Cry
<<effects>>
당신은 <<bhis>> 깃털에 얼굴을 묻고 흐느끼기 시작한다. <<bhim>>【을를】 붙잡고 세상에 대한 모든 불만을 쏟아낸다.
<<bHe>>【은는】 당신이 무너져 내리는 동안 부드럽게 <<if $monster is 1>>쉬쉬하는<<else>>구구거리는<</if>> 소리를 낸다. <<if $monster is 1>>당신의 등을 따라 <<bhis>> 손끝과 날개 끝으로 부드럽게 쓰다듬는다<<else>>당신이 <<bhis>> 깃털 속으로 더 깊이 파고들게 내버려 둔다<</if>>. <<bhis>> 깃털은 <i>터무니없이</i> 부드럽다.
<br><br>

그렇게 한참 있다가, 둘은 서로에게서 떨어진다.
<br><br>

<<if $monster is 1>>
	<<bHe>>【이가】 당신의 어깨에 손을 얹고 눈을 들여다본다. "나는 언제나 <<wife>> 곁에 있을 거야." <<bhe>>【이가】 엄숙하게 말하고는, 당신을 다시 한번 껴안는다.
<<else>>
	<<bHe>>【이가】 나지막이 지저귀고는, 당신의 <<if $bodysize gte 3>>어깨<<else>>뺨<</if>>에 <<bhis>> 얼굴을 비빈다. <<bHe>>【은는】 계속해서 당신에게 바싹 다가붙어, 모든 걱정이 사라지게 한다.
<</if>>
<br><br>

<<beasttype>>【이가】 당신을 위로하는 동안, 당신은 <<bhe>>【이가】 얼마나 친절했는지 생각하게 된다<<if $phase is 4>>, 비록 당신이 <<bhim>>【을를】 공격하려 했음에도 불구하고<</if>>. <<bhe>>【이가】 당신을 두고 안절부절못하는 모습이 놀랍도록 사랑스럽고, 이 허물어져 가는 탑에서 <<bhis>> <<if $monster is 1>><<wife>><<else>>짝<</if>>【이가】 되어 행동하는 것이 마치 집에 온 것처럼 느껴진다.
<span class="red">이건 <<bhis>> 잘못이 아니야. <<bHe>>【은는】 그저 짝을 원할 뿐이야.
<br>
당신은 스톡홀름 증후군: 거대 매 특성을 얻었습니다.</span>
<br><br>

<<loveInterestAdd "Great Hawk">>
<<set $syndromebird to 1>>
<<unset $birdescaped>>
<<run delete $bird.syndrome>>
<br><br>
<<specialClothesUnlock "set" "bird">>

<<link [[다음|Bird Rescue No Syndrome Tower Final]]>><</link>>
<br>

:: Bird Rescue No Syndrome Tower Release
<<effects>>
일이 분 정도 지나고, 당신은 포옹에서 물러난다. <<beasttype>>【을를】 바라보자 <<bhe>>【은는】 당신에게 <<if $monster is 1>>미소 짓는다<<else>>지저귄다<</if>>.
<br><br>

당신은 <<if $monster is 1>>마주<<else>><<bhim>>【을를】 향해<</if>> 미소 짓는다. 그리고 <<bhis>> 머리를 부드럽게 쓰다듬는다. <<if $phase is 4 and currentSkillValue('awareness') gte 300>> 당신이 손을 움직이자 <<bhe>>【이가】 살짝 굳는 것을 놓치지 않는다. 몇 번 쓰다듬자, <<bhis>><<else>><<bhis>><</if>> 눈이 감기고 <<bhe>>【은는】 당신이 <<bhis>> 머리를 쓰다듬자 <<if $monster is 1>>긴장을 푼다<<else>>편안해한다<</if>>.
당신이 끝내자, <<bhe>>【은는】 <<bhis>> 깃털을 부풀리고 일어선다.
<br><br>

<<link [[다음|Bird Rescue No Syndrome Tower Final]]>><</link>>
<br>

:: Bird Rescue No Syndrome Tower Thank
<<effects>>
<<if $speech_attitude is "meek">>
	"구, 구해주셔서 감사합니다." 당신이 말한다.
<<elseif $speech_attitude is "bratty">>
	"거기서 도와줘서 고마워." 당신이 말한다.
<<else>>
	"고마워." 당신이 말한다.
<</if>>
<br><br>

<<beasttype>>【이가】 <<bhis>> 깃털을 부풀린다.
<<if $monster is 1>>
	"언제든 기꺼이 돕지, <<wife>>." <<bhe>>【이가】 말한다.
<<else>>
	<<bHe>>【은는】 <<bhimself>> 스스로를 자랑스러워하는 것 같다.
<</if>>
<br><br>

<<link [[다음|Bird Rescue No Syndrome Tower Final]]>><</link>>
<br>

:: Bird Rescue No Syndrome Tower Silent
<<effects>>
당신은 아무 말도 하지 않고, 그저 <<beasttype>>【을를】 <<if $speech_attitude is "meek">>두려운 듯이<<else>>불신에 찬 눈으로<</if>> 바라볼 뿐이다.

<<if $monster is 1>>
	<<bhis>> 날개가 당신이 반응하지 않자 약간 축 처지고, <<bhis>> 표정은 우울해 보인다.
	<br><br>
	"괜찮아." <<bhe>>【이가】 슬픈 목소리로 말한다. "미안해, <<wife>>."
<<else>>
	<<beasttype>>의 날개가 살짝 처지고, <<bhis>> 깃털이 납작하게 눕는다.
	<<bHe>>【은는】 <<bhis>> 머리를 숙인다<<if !understandsBirdBehaviour()>>. 거의 <</if>>미안하다는 듯이.
<</if>>
<br><br>

<<if $monster is 1>>어색한 <</if>>침묵 속에서 잠시 시간이 흐른 후, <<beasttype>>【이가】 기운을 차린다.
<br><br>

<<link [[다음|Bird Rescue No Syndrome Tower Final]]>><</link>>
<br>

:: Bird Rescue No Syndrome Tower Punch
<<effects>>
당신은 이 기회를 틈타 <<beasttype>>의 날개에 깔끔한 펀치를 날린다. <<bHe>>【은는】 고통스러운 비명을 지르더니, 방 반대편으로 날아간다. <<if currentSkillValue('physique') gte 9000>>당신이 때린 날개를 움직이는 데 약간 어려움을 겪는 것 같다. <</if>>
<br><br>

<<beasttype>>【은는】 탑 건너편에서 상처받은<<if $monster is 1>> 듯 배신당한<</if>> 표정으로 당신을 바라보며, 주기적으로 날개를 시험해 본다. <<if currentSkillValue('physique') gte 12000 and $monster is 1>><<bHe>>【은는】 금방이라도 울음을 터뜨릴 것처럼 보인다.<</if>>
<<if C.npc["Great Hawk"].love gte 65>>
	<<if $monster is 1>>
		"왜?" <<bhe>>【이가】 작은 목소리로 묻는다.
	<<else>>
		<<beasttype>>【이가】 작게 구구거린다.
	<</if>>
	<<bhe>>【이가】 먼 벽에 몸을 바싹 붙인다.
<</if>>
<br><br>

<<set $bird.state to "hunting">>
<<if currentSkillValue('physique') gte 15000>>
	<<pass 20>><<set $bird.timer to 180>>
	둘은 그곳에 조용히 앉아 있다. <<beasttype>>의 날개는 천천히 회복되는 것 같지만, 당신은 <<bhe>>【이가】 이토록 강렬하게 집중하고 있는 동안 움직이고 싶지 않다. <<if $monster is 1>>당신은 <<bhis>> 눈가에 눈물이 맺히는 것을 볼 수 있다. <</if>>일단 <<beasttype>>【이가】 날 수 있다고 생각하면, <<bhe>>【은는】 내내 당신을 주시하며 횃대를 향해 천천히 걸어간다. 그곳에 도착하면 <<bhe>>【은는】 날아가 버리고, 당신은 혼자 남게 된다.
<<elseif currentSkillValue('physique') gte 12000>>
	<<pass 15>><<set $bird.timer to 150>>
	두 사람은 탑 건너편에서 조용한 대치를 유지한다. 당신이 주먹으로 때린 날개를 <<beasttype>>【이가】 가끔씩 뻗는 것 외에는 아무도 움직이지 않는다. <<bhe>>【이가】 날개가 <<bhis>> 체중을 지탱할 만큼 충분히 좋은 상태라고 만족하면, <<bhe>>【은는】 이륙하여 탑에서 날아간다.
<<elseif currentSkillValue('physique') gte 8000>>
	<<pass 10>><<set $bird.timer to 120>>
	두 사람은 다음 10분 동안 방 건너편에서 서로를 쳐다본다. <<beasttype>>【은는】 <<bhis>> 날개를 가만히 두었다가 천천히 폈다 접었다를 반복하며 시간을 보낸다. 날개가 <<bhis>> 만족할 만큼 회복되면, <<beasttype>>【은는】 일어나 탑에서 날아간다.
<<elseif currentSkillValue('physique') gte 4000>>
	<<pass 5>><<set $bird.timer to 90>>
	두 사람은 잠시 그곳에 앉아 서로를 불신에 찬 눈으로 쳐다본다. <<beasttype>>의 날개가 회복된 것 같으면, <<bhe>>【은는】 일어나 탑에서 <<bhimself>> 몸을 날린다.
<<else>>
	<<pass 1>><<set $bird.timer to 60>>
	잠시 휴식을 취한 후, <<beasttype>>【은는】 일어나 당신 쪽을 마지막으로 한 번 쳐다보고는 탑에서 <<bhimself>> 몸을 날린다.
<</if>>
<br><br>

<<link [[다음|Bird Tower]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>

:: Bird Rescue No Syndrome Tower Pull
<<effects>>
당신은 <<beasttype>>의 손길을 피해 물러난다<<if $phase is 1>>, 몸을 웅크리면서<</if>>. <<bHe>>【은는】 이 상황에 <<if C.npc["Great Hawk"].love gte 40>>슬퍼하는<<else>>실망한<</if>> 듯 보이며, <<if C.npc["Great Hawk"].dom gte 60>>물러나 앉지만<<else>>물러나서<</if>> 더 이상 당신을 만지지 않는다.
<br><br>

<<if $monster is 1>>어색하고<<else>>불편한<</if>> 침묵이 탑을 가득 채우고, <<beasttype>>【은는】 한 발에서 다른 발로 <<bhis>> 체중을 옮긴다. 그러다 <<bHe>>【은는】 기운을 차린다<<if $monster is 1 or understandsBirdBehaviour()>>, 좋은 생각이 떠오른 듯이<</if>>.
<br><br>

<<link [[다음|Bird Rescue No Syndrome Tower Final]]>><</link>>
<br>

:: Bird Rescue No Syndrome Tower Final
<<effects>>
<<beasttype>>【이가】 당신을 바라본다. <<if $monster is 1>>미소 짓고<<elseif understandsBirdBehaviour()>>기뻐 보이고<<else>>주의 깊게 보는<</if>> 모습이다.

<<if $monster is 1>>
	"<<Wife>>【은는】 배고플 거야." <<bhe>>【이가】 말한다.
	<<if $phase is 0 or $phase is 1 or $pain gte 80>>
		"먹을 것을 찾아올게. <<Wife>>【은는】 좀 쉬어야 해. 내가 <<wife>>【을를】 지켜줄게. <<Wife>>【은는】 회복해야 해."
	<<else>>
		"먹을 것을 찾아올게."
	<</if>>
	<<bHe>>【은는】 횃대로 걸어가더니, <<bhis>> 날개를 펴고 탑에서 <<bhimself>> 몸을 날린다.
<<else>>
	<<bHe>>【은는】 열정적인 지저귐을 내뱉고는, <<bhis>> 날개를 펴고 날아오른다.
<</if>>
<br><br>

<<set $bird.timer to 20>>
<<set $bird.state to "hunting">>
<<bird_loot lurker 8>><<bird_loot food 16>>

<<link [[다음|Bird Tower]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>

:: Moor Bird Wake
<<effects>>

<<if $syndromebird gte 1>>
	<<npc "Great Hawk">>
	당신은 돌로 된 방에서 깨어난다. 깃털 이불이 당신을 덮고 있다. 그것은 날개다.
	<<if $monster is 1>>
		"네가 괜찮아서 다행이야." <<beasttype>>【이가】 말한다. "잠든 걸 봤어. 아주 위험해. 조심해야 해. 피곤하면 둥지로 와."
	<<else>>
		<<beasttype>>【이가】 당신 옆에서 짹짹거린다.
	<</if>>
	<br><br>

	<<bhis>> 날개가 잠시 당신을 꽉 조였다가, 다시 공간을 내어준다.
	<br><br>

	<<if pcAreArmsBound("any") or $feetuse is "bound">>
		<<bHe>>【은는】 호기심 어린 눈으로 당신의 결박을 보더니, 날카롭게 <<bhis>> 발톱으로 당신을 향해 찬다. <span class="green">당신의 결박이 너덜너덜해져 발치에 떨어진다.</span>
		<<unbind>>
		<br><br>
	<</if>>

	<<set $bird.timer to 60>>
	<<set $bird.state to "home">>

	<<link [[다음|Bird Tower]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
	<br>
<<else>>
	<<npc "Great Hawk">>
	바람이 불자 당신은 공중에 뜬다. 발톱이 당신의 어깨를 움켜쥔다. 당신은 공중 높이 떠 있다. 위를 올려다본다. <<beasttype>>【이가】 당신을 안고, <<bhis>> 깃털 달린 날개를 퍼덕인다.
	<br><br>

	<<link [[다음|Bird Capture]]>><</link>>
	<br>
<</if>>

:: Bird Tower
/* ============ 번역 필요 ============== */
<<if $bird.state is undefined>>
	<<bird_init>>/*Fixes rare broken save issue*/
<</if>>
<<set $location to "tower">><<setTowerTemp>><<effects>><<getTarget true>>
<<bird_schedule>>

You are inside <<if $syndromebird is 1>>your tower<<else>>a ruined tower<</if>>, deep in the moor.
<<switch $bird.upgrades.decor>>
	<<case 1>>The stone walls look a bit more vibrant with decorations set up.
	<<case 2>>Thanks to the decorations you set up, it is starting to look more pleasant.
	<<case 3>>The pretty decorations you have set up make the place feel like home.
	<<case 4 5>>With your beautiful trophies and decorations set up, it looks better than ever.
	<<default>>
<</switch>>
<<if $bird.upgrades.firepit gte 1 and getBirdBurnTime() gt 0>>
	<<if getBirdBurnTime() gt 720>>
		<<if $bird.upgrades.decor gte 3>>
			With lots of light coming from the firepit, your trophies shine pleasingly.
		<<else>>
			The bright light of the firepit reaches all around the tower.
		<</if>>
	<<elseif getBirdBurnTime() gt 360>>
		<<if $bird.upgrades.decor gte 3>>
			The bright light of the firepit makes your trophies shine nicely.
		<<else>>
			The flames of the firepit greatly illuminate the tower.
		<</if>>
	<<elseif getBirdBurnTime() gt 180>>
		The burning firepit illuminates the tower.
	<<else>>
		The lit firepit slightly brightens the tower.
	<</if>>
<</if>>
<<if Weather.precipitation is "rain" or Weather.precipitation is "snow">>
	<<switch $bird.upgrades.shelter>>
		<<case 0>><<= Weather.precipitation is "rain" ? "Rain leaks" : "Snow filters">> through the eroded stone bricks above. <span class="red">The makeshift leaf shelter has collapsed.</span>
		<<case 1>><<= Weather.precipitation is "rain" ? "Rain patters" : "Snow gathers">> against the leaves covering the holes in the roof.
		<<default>>
	<</switch>>
<</if>>
<<if $syndromebird isnot 1>><<hunger_description>><</if>>
<br><br>

<<if isPregnancyEnding() and !$possessed>>
	<<pregnancyPassout "castle">>
<<elseif !$possessed and getBornChildren().find(child => (child.species is "hawk" and child.development.location is "inventory") or (child.development.location is "tower" and childIsUnhatchedEgg(child) and Time.date.timeStamp gte getHatchDate(getPregnancyOf(child))))>>
	/* Move hawk eggs that the player has to the nest */
	<<run getBornChildren().forEach(child => {
		if (child.species is "hawk" and child.development.location is "inventory") {
			if (!V.eggsMoved) V.eggsMoved = [];
			V.eggsMoved.push(child.childId);
			T.movedToTower to true;
			child.development.location to "tower";
		}
		if (child.development.location is "tower" and childIsUnhatchedEgg(child) and Time.date.timeStamp gte getHatchDate(getPregnancyOf(child))) {
			if (!V.eggsHatched) V.eggsHatched = [];
			V.eggsHatched.push(child.childId);
			T.readyToHatch to true;
		}
	})>>
	<<npc "Great Hawk">>
	<<if _movedToTower and _readyToHatch>>
		<<set _eggIcon to $eggsMoved.length>>
		<span class="blue">You gently place your <<pluralise $eggsMoved.length "egg">> in your nest.</span> You feel a sense of relief at seeing <<pluralise $eggsMoved.length "it">> safe. <<if $bird.upgrades.nest gte 2>>You bunch up the fabric to keep <<pluralise $eggsMoved.length "it">> cosy.<</if>> <<Number $eggsMoved.length>> <<birdicon "eggs">> fertilised bird <<pluralise $eggsMoved.length "egg has" "eggs have">> been moved to the nest.
		<br><br>

		<<if $eggsMoved.includesAny($eggsHatched)>>
			Just as you take your hand off of <<if $eggsMoved.length gte 2>>the last one<<else>>it<</if>>, it shakes ever so slightly. You hear a soft crackle and an even softer chirp. <span class="green"><<pluralise $eggsHatched.length "It's" "They're">> hatching!</span>
		<<else>>
			The moment you leave <<pluralise $eggsMoved.length "it">> be, you notice <<number $eggsHatched.length>> of your other eggs start to shake ever so slightly. You hear a soft crackle and an even softer chirp. <span class="green"><<pluralise $eggsHatched.length "It's" "They're">> hatching!</span>
		<</if>>
		<br><br>

		<<link [[Next (0:30)|Bird Tower Hatching]]>><<bird_pass 30>><<set $phase to 1>><</link>>
	<<elseif _readyToHatch>>
		<<if $bird.state is "home">>
			<<if $monster is 1>>
				"<<Wife>>! <<Wife>>, come quickly!" <<your_bird_text "cap">> looks to you with love and excitement
			<<else>>
				You hear excited cawing and chirping. <<your_bird_text "cap">> looks right at you
			<</if>>
			from the edge of the nest. You hear softer chirping coming from it. You rush over.
		<<else>>
			<<set $phase to 1>>
			You hear a soft chirping from your nest. You rush over.
		<</if>>
		<<if $eggsHatched.length gte 2>>
			<span class="green">Some of your eggs are hatching!</span>
		<<else>>
			<<if getChildrenAt("tower").filter(child => childIsUnhatchedEgg(child) and Time.date.timeStamp lt getHatchDate(getPregnancyOf(child))).length gte 2>>
				<span class="green">One of your eggs is hatching!</span>
			<<else>>
				<span class="green">Your egg is hatching!</span>
			<</if>>
		<</if>>
		<br><br>

		<<link [[Next (0:30)|Bird Tower Hatching]]>><<bird_pass 30>><</link>>
	<<else>>
		<<set _eggIcon to $eggsMoved.length>>
		<span class="blue">You gently place your <<pluralise $eggsMoved.length "egg">> in your nest.</span> You feel a sense of relief at seeing <<pluralise $eggsMoved.length "it">> safe. <<if $bird.upgrades.nest gte 2>>You bunch up the fabric to keep them cosy.<</if>> <<Number $eggsMoved.length>> <<birdicon "eggs">> fertilised bird <<pluralise $eggsMoved.length "egg has" "eggs have">> been moved to the nest. <<bird_stockholm 3>><<ggbirdstockholm>>
		<br><br>

		<<if $bird.state is "home">>
			<<your_bird_text "cap">>
			<<switch $bird.activity>>
				<<case "sleep" "rest">>stirs awake,
				<<case "build" "brood">>looks to you,
				<<case "bathe">>hops out of the rainwater pool and quickly <<if $monster is 1>>runs<<else>>hops<</if>> over,
				<<default>>quickly hops over,
			<</switch>>
			puffing out <<bhis>> plumage in surprise upon realising what <<bhe>> sees.
			<<if $monster is 1>>
				<<if getChildrenAt("tower").find(child => child.species is "hawk" and childIsBorn(child))>>
					"I'm so happy, <<wife>>. <span class="lewd">We have more children</span>!" <<bHe>> sweeps you up in a hug, <<if $syndromebird gte 1>>which you can't help but return<<else>>which you don't bother resisting<</if>>.
				<<else>>
					<span class="lewd">"Great Hawk and <<wife>> have children!"</span> <<bHe>> sweeps you up in a hug, <<if $syndromebird gte 1>>which you can't help but return<<else>>which you don't bother resisting<</if>>.
				<</if>>
			<<else>>
				<<bHe>> prods at <<pluralise $eggsMoved.length "it">>, before quickly looking up. <<bHe>> spreads <<bhis>> wings wide, letting out a triumphant shriek into the air. <<bHe>> bobs <<bhis>> head and puffs out <<bhis>> plumage.
				<<bHe>> blusters for a while, before repeatedly headbutting you. <<bHe>> seems excited.
			<</if>>
			<<npcincr "Great Hawk" love 3>><<npcincr "Great Hawk" dom 1>><<gglove>><<gdom>>
			<br><br>

			<<if $syndromebird isnot 1 and $bird.syndrome gte 15>>
				Your eyes wander down to the <<pluralise $eggsMoved.length "egg">>. Your <<pluralise $eggsMoved.length "child">>. Your mind fills with instinctual purpose. You rest your head on <<bhis>> shoulder. <<bHis>> plumage is so soft. Staying here with <<bhim>> doesn't seem so bad anymore.
				<span class="red">It's not <<bhis>> fault. <<bHe>> only wants a mate.
				<br>
				You've gained the Stockholm Syndrome: Great Hawk trait.</span>
				<br><br>
				<<loveInterestAdd "Great Hawk">>
				<<set $syndromebird to 1>>
				<<unset $birdescaped>>
				<<run delete $bird.syndrome>>
				<br><br>
				<<specialClothesUnlock "set" "bird">>
			<</if>>
		<<else>>
			<<set $bird.eggReact to $eggsMoved.length>>
		<</if>>

		<<link [[다음|Bird Tower]]>><<endevent>><<unset $eggsHatched>><<unset $eggsMoved>><</link>>
	<</if>>
	<br>
<<elseif $bird.state is "home" and birdEggsReady("Great Hawk") and !$possessed>>
	<<birdEggLayEvent>>
<<elseif $stress gte $stressmax>>
	You've pushed your body beyond its limits. Everything fades to black.
	<br><br>

	<<link [[다음|Bird Tower Passout]]>><<passout>><<endevent>><<bird_pass 30>><</link>>
	<br>
<<elseif $bird.state is "home" and $bird.activity isnot "sleep" and $bird.eggReact>>
	<<npc "Great Hawk">>
	You see <<your_bird_text>> looking into the nest with awe. <<bHes>> found your <<pluralise $bird.eggReact "egg">>. <<bHe>> looks up, finally noticing you.
	<<if $monster is 1>>
		<<if getChildrenAt("tower").find(child => child.species is "hawk" and childIsBorn(child))>>
			"I'm so happy, <<wife>>. <span class="lewd">We have more children</span>!" <<bHe>> sweeps you up in a hug, <<if $syndromebird gte 1>>which you can't help but return<<else>>which you don't bother resisting<</if>>.
		<<else>>
			<span class="lewd">"Great Hawk and <<wife>> have children!"</span> <<bHe>> sweeps you up in a hug, <<if $syndromebird gte 1>>which you can't help but return<<else>>which you don't bother resisting<</if>>.
		<</if>>
	<<else>>
		<<bHe>> spreads <<bhis>> wings wide, letting out a triumphant shriek into the air. <<bHe>> bobs <<bhis>> head and puffs out <<bhis>> plumage.
		<<bHe>> blusters for a while, before repeatedly headbutting you. <<bHe>> seems excited.
	<</if>>
	<<npcincr "Great Hawk" love 3>><<gglove>>
	<br><br>

	<<if $syndromebird isnot 1 and $bird.syndrome gte 15>>
		Your eyes wander down to the <<pluralise $bird.eggReact "egg">>. Your <<pluralise $bird.eggReact "child">>. Your mind fills with instinctual purpose. You rest your head on <<bhis>> shoulder. <<bHis>> plumage is so soft. Staying here with <<bhim>> doesn't seem so bad anymore.
		<span class="red">It's not <<bhis>> fault. <<bHe>> only wants a mate.
		<br>
		You've gained the Stockholm Syndrome: Great Hawk trait.</span>
		<br><br>
		<<loveInterestAdd "Great Hawk">>
		<<set $syndromebird to 1>>
		<<unset $birdescaped>>
		<<run delete $bird.syndrome>>
		<br><br>
		<<specialClothesUnlock "set" "bird">>
	<</if>>
	<<run delete $bird.eggReact>>

	<<link [[다음|Bird Tower]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
	<br>
<<elseif $bird.state is "hunting" and $bird.timer lte 0 and !$possessed>>
	<<npc "Great Hawk">>
	You hear the flap of wings as the <<beasttype>> returns.

	<<bHe>> lands and <<if $monster is 1>>walks<<else>>hops<</if>> over to you.
	<<bird_hunt_return>>
<<elseif $bird.state is "home" and !["brood","sleep"].includes($bird.activity) and !$bird.override and Weather.dayState isnot "night" and $bird.timer lte 0 and !$possessed>>
	<<npc "Great Hawk">>
	<<bird_hunt_start>>
<<elseif $bird.state is "home" and $bird.lock is 1 and $syndromebird is 1 and !$possessed>>
	<<npc "Great Hawk">>
	The <<beasttype>> <<if $monster is 1>>walks<<else>>hops<</if>> deeper into the room. <<bHe>> pauses beside the trapdoor and holds the rusted lock between <<bhis>> talons. <<bHe>> crushes it in one swift movement, grasps the remaining metal, and throws open the door.
	<<if $bird.clean lte 15>>
		<<bHe>> jumps away from the cloud of dust.
	<</if>>
	<br><br>

	<<if $monster is 1>>
		"Easier for you to leave," <<bhe>> says. "If I'm out. Just don't be gone long, <<wife>>. The nest is cold without you."
	<<else>>
		<<bHe>> nods towards the hole, then back to the nest, and chirps.
	<</if>>
	<br><br>

	You peer into the gloom. A flight of stone stairs spirals into the dark.
	<br><br>
	<<run delete $bird.lock>>

	<<link [[다음|Bird Tower]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
	<br>
<<elseif $bird.upgrades.mirror is 1 and $bird.mirror_unknown is 1 and $bird.state is "home" and !$possessed>>
	<<run delete $bird.mirror_unknown>>
	<<npc "Great Hawk">>
	You hear a screech. The <<beasttype>> hovers in the air, talons outstretched, gaze fixed on the new mirror, on <<bhis>> reflection.
	<br><br>

	<<if $speech_attitude is "meek">>
		"I-It's just a mirror," you say. "I wanted one for our home."
	<<elseif $speech_attitude is "bratty">>
		"Quit whining," you say. "It's just a mirror."
	<<else>>
		"What's wrong?" you ask. "It's just a mirror."
	<</if>>
	<br><br>
	<<if $monster gte 1>>
		The <<beasttype>> lands. "I hate it," <<bhe>> says. <<bHis>> talons bite into the stone. "Dangerous. But if you like it—" <<bHe>> grimaces. "Put something over it when you're not using it."
	<<else>>
		<<bHe>> chirps, and <<bhis>> talons bite into the stone. <<bHe>> flies off for a moment, returning with a large, torn piece of fabric, and drops it on the mirror.
	<</if>>
	<br><br>

	<<link [[다음|Bird Tower]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
	<br>
<<elseif $bird.state is "home" and $bird.activity is "build" and $bird.upgrades.shelter gte 2 and $birdShelterTimer and $birdShelterTimer lte 0 and !$possessed>>
	<<npc "Great Hawk">><<set _loot to either("stick", "leaf")>><<wearProp _loot>>
	You see the <<beasttype>> carrying some sticks and leaves to repair the shelter. <<bHe>> stops when <<bhe>> sees what you've built in the old shelter's place.
	<br><br>

	<<if $monster is 1>>
		"<<Wife>> did this?" <<bHe>> gives the tarp a hefty tug, and looks impressed when it holds. <<bHe>> smiles wide, before walking up to you and hugging you.
		"Had to fix the old one so many times. Many soggy, sleepless nights. Thank you." <<bHe>> looks at you with adoration.
	<<else>>
		<<bHe>> pokes and prods at the tarp, pulling at it to test it. You're about to stop <<bhim>>, but <<bhe>> looks to you and starts chirping.
		<<bHe>> puffs out <<bhis>> plumage and starts bobbing <<bhis>> head. <<bHe>> seems to be happy with what you've done.
	<</if>>
	<<npcincr "Great Hawk" love 6>><<ggglove>>
	<br><br>

	<span class="teal">You save the sticks and leaves <<bhe>> was carrying for later.</span> <<set $bird.materials.sticks += 2>><<set $bird.materials.leaves += 2>>
	<br><br>
	<<unset $birdShelterTimer>>

	<<link [[다음|Bird Tower]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
	<br>
<<elseif $bird.state is "home" and $bird.activity is "bathe" and $bird.upgrades.pot gte 3 and getBirdBurnTime() gte 1 and $bird.heat_unknown and !$possessed>>
	<<run delete $bird.heat_unknown>>
	<<npc "Great Hawk">>
	You see your <<if $monster is 1>><<nnpc_wife "Great Hawk">><<else>>partner<</if>> walk to the rainwater pool. <<bHe>> stops in front of it, noticing the steam coming out of it.
	<br><br>

	<<if $monster is 1>>
		<<bHe>> turns to look at you. "Did <<wife>> do something to the water? It's warm now," <<bhe>> says. You tell <<bhim>> you found a way to heat the water. <<bHe>> looks surprised. "<<Wife>> can do that? Incredible." <<bHe>> marvels at your feat of ingenuity.
	<<else>>
		<<bHe>> looks at you and tilts <<bhis>> head. You tell <<bhim>> you found a way to heat the water. The <<beasttype>> stares at you in awe, likely wondering how it's possible.
	<</if>>
	<br><br>

	<<bHe>> steps into the water and shudders, likely feeling hot water for the first time. <<bHe>> seems a bit tense at first, but quickly warms up to the idea of a warm bath.
	<<if $monster is 1>>
		"This feels good, thank you for this, <<wife>>."
	<<else>>
		<<bHe>> chirps gleefully, happy to have warm water.
	<</if>>
	You leave <<bhim>> to enjoy the water. <<npcincr "Great Hawk" love 1>><<glove>>
	<br><br>

	<<link [[다음|Bird Tower]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
	<br>
<<elseif $bird.state is "home" and $bird.activity is "bathe" and $bird.upgrades.pot gte 3 and getBirdBurnTime() is 0 and !$bird.heat_unknown and !$daily.birdHeatRequest and Weather.temperature lte 15 and !$possessed>>
	<<set $daily.birdHeatRequest to true>>
	<<npc "Great Hawk">>
	<<your_bird_text "cap">> approaches you.
	<<if $monster is 1>>
		"Could <<wife>> make the water warm again?" <<bhe>> asks.
	<<else>>
		<<bHe>> motions towards the bathing pool and squawks. <<bHe>> is asking you to heat the water again.
	<</if>>
	<br><br>

	<<birdicon "wood">>
	<<if $bird.materials.wood is 0>>
		<span class="red">No wood to add.</span>
	<<else>>
		<<set _timeWood to 240>>
		<<if Weather.precipitation is "rain" and $bird.upgrades.shelter is 0>>
			<<set _timeWood to Math.floor(_timeWood / 2)>>
		<</if>>
		<<link [[Add wood|Bird Tower Warm Bath]]>>
			<<wearProp "wood">>
			<<set $phase to 1>><<npcincr "Great Hawk" love 1>><<set $bird.materials.wood-->>
			<<run Cooker.addBurnTime($bird.firepit, _timeWood * 60)>>
			<<run Weather.Observables.checkForUpdate()>>
		<</link>><<glove>><<note `"+ " + getTimeString(240)` `"green"`>>
	<</if>>
	<br>
	<<birdicon "sticks">>
	<<if $bird.materials.sticks is 0>>
		<span class="red">No sticks to add.</span>
	<<else>>
		<<set _timeSticks to 60>>
		<<if Weather.precipitation is "rain" and $bird.upgrades.shelter is 0>>
			<<set _timeSticks to Math.floor(_timeSticks / 2)>>
		<</if>>
		<<link [[Add sticks|Bird Tower Warm Bath]]>>
			<<wearProp "stick">>
			<<set $phase to 1>><<npcincr "Great Hawk" love 1>><<set $bird.materials.sticks-->>
			<<run Cooker.addBurnTime($bird.firepit, _timeSticks * 60)>>
			<<run Weather.Observables.checkForUpdate()>>
		<</link>><<glove>><<note `"+ " + getTimeString(60)` `"green"`>>
	<</if>>
	<br>
	<<getouticon>><<link [[Refuse|Bird Tower Warm Bath]]>><<npcincr "Great Hawk" dom -1>><</link>><<ldom>>
	<br>
<<elseif $bird.upgrades.wardrobe is 1 and $bird.wardrobe_timer lte 1 and $bird.state is "home" and !$possessed>>
	<<run delete $bird.wardrobe_timer>>
	<<npc "Great Hawk">>
	You see the <<beasttype>>'s lower half sticking out of your wardrobe. You walk up behind <<bhim>>.
	<br><br>

	<<if $speech_attitude is "meek">>
		"W-what are you doing?" you ask.
	<<elseif $speech_attitude is "bratty">>
		"Hey, no, stop that! Why are you in my wardrobe?" you ask.
	<<else>>
		"What are you doing?" you ask.
	<</if>>
	<<bHe>> jumps in surprise.
	<br><br>

	<<if $monster is 1>>
		<<bHes>> holding a torn piece of fabric. It looks like <<bhe>> was trying to hang it up. "Still don't understand landbound plumage. Sorry." <<bHe>> hands it to you apologetically before walking away.
	<<else>>
		<<bHe>> holds a torn piece of fabric in <<bhis>> beak. It looks like <<bhe>> was trying to put it in your wardrobe. <<bHe>> drops it at your feet apologetically before hopping away.
	<</if>>
	<<wearProp "rag">>
	<<set $bird.materials.fabric ++>>
	<br><br>

	<<link [[다음|Bird Tower]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
	<br>
<<elseif $bird.syndrome gte 20 and $syndromebird isnot 1 and $bird.state is "home" and $bird.activity isnot "sleep" and !$possessed>>
	<<npc "Great Hawk">>
	You watch the <<beasttype>> stare over the moor, just as <<bhe>> always does. Maybe it's how the light catches in <<bhis>> feathers, but <<bhe>> looks more majestic today. You catch yourself admiring <<bhim>> for a moment. When you realise what you're doing, you notice the <<beasttype>> is staring back at you.
	<<if $monster is 1>>
		"Does <<wife>> want to come look with me?" <<bhe>> asks.
	<<else>>
		<<bHe>> flaps <<bhis>> wings at you, beckoning you to come look at the moor with <<bhim>>.
	<</if>>
	<br><br>

	You decide to take <<bhim>> up on the offer and sit down next to <<bhim>> on the perch. <<bHe>> wraps a wing around you, sheltering you from the wind. You watch over the moor with <<bhim>> for some time. Eventually, the <<beasttype>> shuffles closer to you and
	<<if $monster is 1>>
		speaks. "I'm glad <<wife>> wants to be close now." <<bHe>> sounds happy.
	<<else>>
		chirps softly. <<bHe>> seems to be happy that you're willing to be so close to <<bhim>> now.
	<</if>>
	<br><br>

	You stay huddled up to <<bhim>> for a while longer, but eventually pull away. <<bHe>> looks disappointed, but doesn't complain. You look at <<bhim>> once more and smile. Maybe staying with <<bhim>> won't be so bad after all.
	<span class="red">It's not <<bhis>> fault. <<bHe>> only wants a mate.
	<br>
	You've gained the Stockholm Syndrome: Great Hawk trait.</span>
	<br><br>
	<<loveInterestAdd "Great Hawk">>
	<br><br>
	<<set $syndromebird to 1>>
	<<unset $birdescaped>>
	<<run delete $bird.syndrome>>
	<<specialClothesUnlock "set" "bird">>
	<<link [[다음|Bird Tower]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
	<br>
<<elseif $harpy gte 6 and $bird.hunts.unlocked is true and $bird.hunts.valuables is false and $skulduggery gte 300>>
	<<set $bird.hunts.valuables to true>>
	<span class="blue">As you're looking around the tower, your eyes catch on a vacant corner. You become keenly aware of how empty and plain everything is, and you're filled with an inexplicable urge. Some pretty, shiny valuables would improve the atmosphere of your home.</span>
	<br>
	<span class="gold">You can now hunt for valuables.</span>
	<br><br>

	<<link [[다음|Bird Tower]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
	<br>
<<elseif $bird.state is "home" and ["clear","lightClouds"].includes(Weather.name) and between(Time.hour, 21, 23) and !Weather.bloodMoon and $daily.birdNightFlightTrigger and !$weekly.birdNightFlight and !Weather.isFrozen("lake") and !$bird.injured>>
	<<npc "Great Hawk">><<person1>>
	<<set $weekly.birdNightFlight to true>>
	<<your_bird_text "cap">> perches on a weathered ledge. Moonlight bathes <<bhim>> in a silvery glow.
	<br><br>

	<<if $monster is 1>>
		"Come, <<wife>>. Fly with me." <<bHis>> voice carries a tender plea as <<bhe>>
		<<if $harpy gte 6 and $birdFly is 1 and !$plucked>>
			extends <<bhis>> massive talon toward you.
		<<else>>
			crouches down, making room for you to climb onto <<bhis>> back.
		<</if>>
	<<else>>
		<<bHe>> lets out a low trill, nodding out to the moor. <<bHe>> wants you to fly with <<bhim>>.
		<<if $harpy lt 6 or $birdFly isnot 1 and !$plucked>>
			<<bHe>> gets low to the ground, motioning for you to climb onto <<bhis>> back.
		<</if>>
	<</if>>
	<br><br>

	<<link [[Go|Bird Tower Night Flight]]>><<bird_pass 30>><<npcincr "Great Hawk" love 1>><</link>><<glove>>
	<br>
	<<link [[Stay|Bird Tower Night Flight Stay]]>><</link>>
	<br>
<<else>>
	<<npc "Great Hawk">><<person1>>
	<<if $bird.state is "home">>
		<<switch $bird.activity>>
			<<case "sing">>
				<<your_bird_text "cap">> is singing at the edge of the tower.
			<<case "bathe">>
				<<your_bird_text "cap">> is bathing in the rainwater pool.
			<<case "groom">>
				<<your_bird_text "cap">> sits on <<bhis>> perch, cleaning <<bhis>> feathers.
			<<case "rest">>
				<<your_bird_text "cap">> rests in the nest.
			<<case "build">>
				<<if $birdShelterRepair>>
					<<unset $birdShelterRepair>>
					<span class="teal"><<your_bird_text "cap">> is covering the holes in the roof with leaves and twigs.</span>
				<<else>>
					<<your_bird_text "cap">> is adding to the nest.
				<</if>>
			<<case "brood">>
				<<set _eggCountNest to nestEggCount()>>
				<<your_bird_text "cap">> sits in the nest, brooding on the <<pluralise _eggCountNest "egg">>.
			<<default>>
				<<your_bird_text "cap">> rests in <<bhis>> nest.
				<<set $birdSleep to 1>>
		<</switch>>
	<<else>>
		<<your_bird_text "cap">> is out hunting.
	<</if>>
	<<if $exposed gte 1>>
		<<if $syndromebird is 1>>
			<<if $arousal gte $arousalmax / 2 and $bird.state isnot "home">>
				You find yourself craving <<your_bird_text>>'s wings to keep you warm.
			<</if>>
		<<else>>
			<<if $bird.state isnot "home">>
				<<if $uncomfortable.nude is true>>
					You feel relieved to have some privacy in your exposed state.
				<</if>>
			<<else>>
				<<if $uncomfortable.nude is true>>
					You feel embarrassed to be exposed around the <<beasttype>>.
				<<else>>
					You feel excited to be exposed around the <<beasttype>>.
				<</if>>
			<</if>>
		<</if>>
	<</if>>
	<br>
	<<if $syndromebird and $lurkers_held gte 1 and $bird.state is "home" and $bird.activity is "build">>
		<<birdicon "lurkers_netted">><<link "Give <<bhim>> your captured lurker" "Bird Tower Give Captured Lurker">><</link>><<glove>>
		<br>
	<</if>>
	<<if $estate_fence is "quest" and $syndromebird is 1 and $bird.state is "home" and !["sleep","rest"].includes($bird.activity) and $bird.injured is 0>>
		<<socialiseicon "ask">><<link [[Ask for help getting into the Remy Estate|Bird Tower Estate]]>><</link>>
		<br>
	<</if>>
	<<if $bird.hunts.estate is "unlocked" and $bird.state is "home" and !["sleep","rest"].includes($bird.activity) and $bird.injured is 0>>
		<<socialiseicon "ask">><<link [[Ask for help stealing from the estate|Bird Hunt Estate Prepare]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
		<br>
	<</if>>

	<br>
	<<if $arousal gte $arousalmax>>
		<<orgasm>>
		<<if $bird.state isnot "home">>
			Nothing is around to witness your lewdity.
		<<else>>
			<<if $bird.activity is "sleep">>
				The <<beasttype>> stirs in the nest, but doesn't wake up.
			<<else>>
				You feel a warm pair of wings wrap around you, holding you as your spasms subside.
				<<if $monster is 1>>
					"<<Wife>> needed release? Should have said something. Will help next time." The <<beasttype>> pecks you on the cheek, before returning to what <<bhe>> was doing.
				<<else>>
					The <<beasttype>> pecks you on the cheek before returning to what <<bhe>> was doing.
				<</if>>
			<</if>>
		<</if>>
		<br><br>
	<</if>>
	<<if $possessed and (pcAreArmsBound("any") or $feetuse is "bound" or $worn.feet.type.includes("shackle"))>>
		You stare down at your bindings.
		<<if breakableSoftBinding()>>
			You pull, and they fall apart, unable to hold against you.
			<<if ["ankle cuffs", "ball and chain"].includes($worn.feet.name)>>
				You then hear a click, and your $worn.feet.name fall to the ground.
			<</if>>
		<<else>>
			You hear a click, and your $worn.feet.name fall to the ground.
		<</if>>
		<br><br>
		<<unbind>>
	<<elseif breakableSoftBinding() or ["ankle cuffs", "ball and chain"].includes($worn.feet.name) and $bird.state is "home">>
		<<undobindingsicon>><<link [[Undo your bindings (0:10)|Bird Tower Unbind]]>><<bird_pass 10>><<unbind>><</link>>
		<br><br>
	<</if>>

	<<birdicon "perch">><<link [[Approach the perch|Bird Tower Perch]]>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<if $syndromebird isnot 1>>
		<<crimeicon "mark">><<link [[Look out the tower (0:05)|Bird Tower Look]]>><<bird_pass 5>><</link>>
		<br>
		<<investigateicon>><<link [[Search for materials (1:00)|Bird Tower Search]]>><<bird_pass 60>><</link>>
		<br>
	<</if>>
	<<birdicon "rainwater">><<link [[Sit by the rainwater pool|Bird Tower Rainwater Pool]]>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<if $syndromebird is 1 and !(pcAreArmsBound("any") or $feetuse is "bound")>>
		<<if $bird.upgrades.firepit is 3>>
			<<birdicon "firepit">><<link [[Examine the bonfire|Bird Tower Firepit]]>><</link>><<if getBirdBurnTime()>> | <span class="orange"><<firepitTime>></span><</if>>
			<br>
		<<elseif $bird.upgrades.firepit gte 1>>
			<<birdicon "firepit">><<link [[Examine the firepit|Bird Tower Firepit]]>><</link>><<if getBirdBurnTime()>> | <span class="orange"><<firepitTime>></span><</if>>
			<br>
		<</if>>
	<</if>>
	<br>

	<<if $bird.clean gte 100>>
		<<if $bird.upgrades.decor gte 4>>
			<span class="green">Your tower is immaculate.</span>
		<<else>>
			<span class="green">Your tower is perfectly clean.</span>
		<</if>>
	<<else>>
		<<if $syndromebird gte 1>>
			<<if $bird.clean gte 80>>
				The tower is <span class="teal">clean,</span> save for a few bits of dirt in between stone bricks.
			<<elseif $bird.clean gte 60>>
				The tower is <span class="lblue">tidy,</span> but you know you can do better.
			<<elseif $bird.clean gte 40>>
				The tower is <span class="blue">acceptable.</span> Loose stones and dirt have been thrown from the perch.
			<<elseif $bird.clean gte 20>>
				The tower is <span class="purple">a bit messy.</span> Dirt stubbornly sticks to various surfaces.
			<<elseif $bird.clean gte 10>>
				The tower is <span class="pink">a mess.</span> It's better than when you first arrived, at least.
			<<else>>
				The tower is <span class="red">filthy.</span> Erosion and neglect have left a musty stench in the air.
			<</if>>
		<</if>>
		<br>
		<<if $tiredness gte (C.tiredness.max / 5) * 4>>
			<span class="red">You're too exhausted to clean the tower.</span>
		<<else>>
			<<if $worn.handheld.name is "feather duster" or $bird.duster is true or ($bird.upgrades.wardrobe is 1 and getOwnedClothingCount(10, "handheld") gte 1)>>
				<<choreicon "sweep">><<link [[Dust the tower (0:30)|Bird Tower Tidy]]>><<tiredness 3>><<if !$daily.birdHousekeepingSyndrome>><<bird_stockholm 1>><<npcincr "Great Hawk" love 1>><<npcincr "Great Hawk" dom 1>><<set $daily.birdHousekeepingSyndrome to true>><</if>><<housekeeping 2 200>><<bird_pass 30>><</link>><<gtiredness>><<ghousekeeping 200 "silent">>
			<<else>>
				<<choreicon "sweep">><<link [[Tidy up the tower (1:00)|Bird Tower Tidy]]>><<tiredness 6>><<if !$daily.birdHousekeepingSyndrome>><<bird_stockholm 1>><<npcincr "Great Hawk" love 1>><<npcincr "Great Hawk" dom 1>><<set $daily.birdHousekeepingSyndrome to true>><</if>><<housekeeping 2 100>><<bird_pass 60>><</link>><<ggtiredness>><<ghousekeeping 100 "silent">>
			<</if>>
			<<if !$daily.birdHousekeepingSyndrome>><<gbirdstockholm>><<glove>><<gdom>><</if>>
		<</if>>
	<</if>>
	<br>
	<<if $syndromebird is 1 and !(pcAreArmsBound("any") or $feetuse is "bound")>>
		<<choreicon "fix">><<link [[Improve the tower|Bird Tower Build]]>><</link>>
		<br>
	<</if>>
	<br>

	<<birdicon "nest">><<link [[Sleep in the nest|Bird Tower Bed]]>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<if getChildrenAt("tower").find(child => child.species is "hawk" and childIsUnhatchedEgg(child))>>
		<<set _eggIcon to nestEggCount()>>
		<<if _eggIcon gte 2>>
			<<birdicon "eggs">><<link [[Brood on your eggs (0:30)|Bird Tower Brood]]>><<set $phase to 1>><<transform bird 1>><<trauma -3>><</link>><<ltrauma>>
			<br>
		<<else>>
			<<birdicon "eggs">><<link [[Brood on your egg (0:30)|Bird Tower Brood]]>><<set $phase to 1>><<transform bird 1>><<trauma -3>><</link>><<ltrauma>>
			<br>
		<</if>>
	<</if>>
	<<if getChildrenAt("tower").find(child => child.species is "hawk" and childIsBorn(child))>>
		<<set _childrenTotal to getChildrenAt("tower").filter(child => childIsBorn(child)).length>>
		<<if _childrenTotal gte 2>>
			<<birdicon "children">><<link [[Check on your children|Childrens Home]]>><<set $exitPassage to $passage>><</link>>
		<<else>>
			<<birdicon "children">><<link [[Check on your child|Childrens Home]]>><<set $exitPassage to $passage>><</link>>
		<</if>>
		<br>
	<</if>>
	<<if $syndromebird isnot 1>>
		<<bedicon "zzz">><<link [[Sleep elsewhere|Bird Tower Bed Alone]]>><<bird_stockholm -2>><</link>><<if $syndromebird isnot 1>><<lbirdstockholm>><</if>>
		<br>
	<</if>>
	<<if $bird.upgrades.wardrobe is 1>>
		<<birdicon "wardrobe">><<link [[Wardrobe|Bird Tower Wardrobe]]>><</link>>
		<br>
	<<else>>
		<<if $bird.duster is true>>
			<<icon "clothes/feather-duster.png">><<link [[Grab your feather duster|Bird Tower]]>><<handheldstrip>><<handheldwear "feather duster">><<run delete $bird.duster>><</link>>
			<<if $worn.handheld.name isnot "naked">>
				| <span class="blue">Swap out your $worn.handheld.name</span>
			<</if>>
			<br>
		<<elseif $worn.handheld.name is "feather duster">>
			<<icon "clothes/feather-duster.png">><<link [[Hang up your feather duster|Bird Tower]]>><<if $carried.handheld.name isnot "naked">><<handheldon>><<else>><<handheldruined true>><</if>><<set $bird.duster to true>><</link>>
			<<if $carried.handheld.name isnot "naked">>
				| <span class="blue">Retrieve your $carried.handheld.name</span>
			<</if>>
			<br>
		<</if>>
	<</if>>
	<<if $bird.upgrades.mirror is 1>>
		<<if $nextPassageCheck is "Bird Tower Mirror">>
			<span class="nextLink"><<birdicon "mirror">><<link [[Mirror|Bird Tower Mirror]]>><<preMirror>><</link>></span>
		<<else>>
			<<birdicon "mirror">><<link [[Mirror|Bird Tower Mirror]]>><<preMirror>><</link>>
		<</if>>
		<br>
	<</if>>
	<br>
	<<if $bird.lock is 1>>
		<<birdicon "trapdoor">><<link [[Examine the trapdoor (0:05)|Bird Tower Door]]>><<bird_pass 5>><</link>>
		<br>
	<<else>>
		<<birdicon "trapdoor">><<link [[Enter the trapdoor (0:05)|Bird Tower Base Descend]]>><<bird_pass 5>><</link>>
		<br>
	<</if>>
	<<if $syndromebird is 1>>
		<br>
		<<link [[Gameplay Settings|Settings]]>><<set $settingsExitPassage to "Bird Tower">><</link>>
		<br>
		<<attitudesControlCheck>>
		<<if $attitudesControl.showGoldLink is true>>
			<span class="goldLink"><<link [[Attitudes]]>><<set $attitudesExitPassage to $passage>><</link>> </span><span class="red">!!</span>
		<<else>>
			<<link [[Attitudes]]>><<set $attitudesExitPassage to $passage>><</link>>
		<</if>>
		<br><br>
	<</if>>
	<<endevent>>
<</if>>

:: Bird Tower Passout
<<setTowerTemp>><<effects>>
<<npc "Great Hawk">>
<<if $syndromebird gte 1>>
	의식을 되찾기 시작하자, 당신은 둥지 안에 있는 자신을 발견한다. 둥지 가장자리에 서 있는 당신의 <<if $monster is 1>><<nnpc_wife "Great Hawk">><<else>>파트너<</if>>【이가】 보인다.
	당신이 깨어나는 것을 본 <<bhe>>【은는】 당신에게 달려온다.
	<<if $monster is 1>>
		"<<Wife>>! 무슨 일이야? 왜 땅바닥에서 잠들었어?" <<bhe>>【이가】 명백히 걱정하며 묻는다.
	<<else>>
		<<bHe>>【이가】 당신을<<if understandsBirdBehaviour()>> 혼란스럽고 걱정스러운 듯<<else>> 강렬하게<</if>> 쳐다본다.
	<</if>>
	당신은 <<bhim>>에게 이제 괜찮다고 말한다.
	<br><br>

	<<if $monster is 1>>
		"정말이야?" <<bhe>>【이가】 여전히 걱정하며 묻는다.
	<<else>>
		<<bHe>>【은는】 약간 안도한 듯 보이지만, 여전히 걱정하고 있다.
	<</if>>
	<br><br>

	<<link "<<bhim>>【을를】 안심시킨다" "Bird Tower Passout Syndrome">><<set $phase to 0>><<npcincr "Great Hawk" dom 1>><</link>><<gdom>>
	<br>
	<<link "<<bhim>>【을를】 무시한다" "Bird Tower Passout Syndrome">><<set $phase to 1>><<npcincr "Great Hawk" dom -1>><</link>><<ldom>>
	<br>
<<else>>
	<<if $trauma gte ($traumamax / 10) * 8>>
		의식을 되찾기 시작하자, 당신은 <<beasttype>>의 둥지 안에 있는 자신을 발견한다. 둥지 가장자리에 서 있는 <<beasttype>>【이가】 보인다.
		<br><br>

		<<bhis>> 시선이 당신을 꿰뚫는 것이 느껴진다. <span class="red">과거에 어떻게 폭행당했는지에 대한 기억이 마음속에 홍수처럼 밀려온다. 공포가 당신을 덮쳐 그 자리에 얼어붙게 만든다.</span>
		<br><br>

		<<beasttype>>【이가】 둥지 안으로 들어와
		<<if $monster is 1>>
			무언가 말하지만,
		<<else>>
			어떤 소리를 내지만,
		<</if>>
		정신이 너무 흐트러져 이해할 수 없다. <<bHe>>【이가】 당신에게 다가오기 시작한다. 몸이 움직이려 하지 않아, 당신은 그저 <<bhe>>【이가】 다가오는 것을 지켜볼 수밖에 없다.
		<br><br>

		<<link [[다음|Bird Tower Passout No Syndrome Trauma]]>><</link>>
		<br>
	<<else>>
		의식을 되찾기 시작하자, 당신은 <<beasttype>>의 둥지 안에 있는 자신을 발견한다. 둥지 가장자리에 서 있는 <<beasttype>>【이가】 보인다.
		<<bHe>>【은는】 당신을 <<if understandsBirdBehaviour()>>걱정스럽게<<else>>강렬하게<</if>> 쳐다보고 있다..
		<br><br>

		<<bHe>>【이가】 둥지 안으로 들어온다.
		<<if $monster is 1>>
			"<<wife>> 아픈가? 무슨 일 있었나?" <<bhe>>【이가】 묻는다.
		<<else>>
			<<bHe>>【은는】 <<if understandsBirdBehaviour()>>부드럽게 <</if>>지저귄다당신을 향해.
		<</if>>
		<br><br>

		<<beasttype>>【이가】 당신에게 <<if understandsBirdBehaviour()>>조심스럽게<<else>>천천히<</if>> 다가오기 시작한다..
		<br><br>

		<<link [[가만히 있는다|Bird Tower Passout No Syndrome]]>><<set $phase to 0>><<bird_stockholm 3>><</link>><<ggbirdstockholm>>
		<br>
		<<link [[몸을 뒤로 뺀다|Bird Tower Passout No Syndrome]]>><<set $phase to 1>><<bird_stockholm -3>><</link>><<llbirdstockholm>>
		<br>
	<</if>>
<</if>>

:: Bird Tower Passout No Syndrome
<<setTowerTemp>><<effects>>

<<if $phase is 0>>
	당신은 <<beasttype>>【이가】 가까이 다가오도록 내버려 둔다. <<bHe>>【은는】 <<bhis>> <<if $monster is 1>>손<<else>>부리<</if>>【으로로】 당신을 만지며 부상 흔적이 있는지 몸을 살피기 시작한다. <<bhis>> 손길은 매우 부드럽게 느껴진다. <<bHe>>【은는】 한동안 당신을 계속 만진다.
	<br><br>

	당신이 <<bhis>> 애무를 즐기기 시작할 때쯤, <<bhe>>【은는】 몸을 뗀다.
	<<if $monster is 1>>
		"<<Wife>>【은는】 심하게 다친 것 같지 않군. 그래도, <<wife>>【은는】 이제 쉬어야 해. 네가 안전했으면 좋겠어." <<bhe>>【이가】 말한다.
	<<else>>
		<<bHe>>【은는】 <<bhis>> 부리로 당신을 마지막으로 한 번 툭 치고는 부드럽게 지저귄다. <<if understandsBirdBehaviour()>><<bHe>>【은는】 당신이 괜찮아 보여서 기쁜 것 같다.<</if>>
	<</if>>
	<br><br>

	<<if $bird.syndrome gte 15 and $syndromebird isnot 1>>
		당신은 <<beasttype>>의 눈에서 보살핌의 시선을 보고 깨달음을 얻는다. <<bHe>>【은는】 지금까지 당신을 돌보려고만 했던 것이다. 당신은 <<bhim>>【와과】 함께라면 안전하다는 것을 안다. 당신은 <<beasttype>>【을를】 끌어안는다.
		<<if $monster is 1>>
			<<bHe>>【은는】 당신의 포옹에 화답한다.
		<<else>>
			<<bHe>>【은는】 답례로 <<bhis>> 날개를 당신 주위로 감싼다.
		<</if>>
		당신은 잠시 <<bhim>>【을를】 안고 있다가 놓아준다. 당신은 <<bhim>>에게 환하게 미소 짓는다.
		<<if $monster is 1>>
			"<<wife>>【이가】 나아져서 기쁘군." <<bhe>>【이가】 말한다.
		<</if>>

		<span class="red">이건 <<bhis>> 잘못이 아니야. <<bHe>>【은는】 그저 짝을 원할 뿐이야.
		<br>
		스톡홀름 증후군: 거대 매 특성을 얻었습니다.</span>
		<br><br>
		<<loveInterestAdd "Great Hawk">>
		<<set $syndromebird to 1>>
		<<unset $birdescaped>>
		<<run delete $bird.syndrome>>
		<<specialClothesUnlock "set" "bird">>
	<<else>>
		당신은 일어나서 둥지 밖으로 나가려고 한다. <<beasttype>>【은는】 당신을 막지 않는다.
	<</if>>
<<else>>
	당신은 둥지 반대편으로 물러난다.
	<<if $speech_attitude is "meek">>
		"제-제발 해치지 마세요." 당신은 흐느낀다.
	<<elseif $speech_attitude is "bratty">>
		"더러운 <<beasttype>>! 만지지 마!" 당신은 소리친다.
	<<else>>
		"저리 가!" 당신은 비명을 지른다.
	<</if>>
	<br><br>

	<<bHe>>【은는】 멈춘다.
	<<if $monster is 1>>
		"<<wife>>【이가】 저렇게 많이 움직일 수 있다면 괜찮은 거겠지, 방해해서 미안해." <<bhe>>【이가】 말한다. <<if understandsBirdBehaviour()>><<bHe>>【은는】 여전히 당신을 걱정하는 것 같다.<</if>>
	<<else>>
		<<bHe>>【은는】 <<if understandsBirdBehaviour()>>당신을 훑어보고,<<else>>잠시 당신을 빤히 바라보다가,<</if>> 곧 약하게 꽥 울음소리를 낸다.
	<</if>>
	당신은 일어나서 둥지 밖으로 나가려고 한다. <<beasttype>>【은는】 당신을 막지 않는다.
<</if>>
<br><br>

<<if $bird.state is "hunting" and $bird.timer lte 0>>
	<<bHe>>【은는】 무언가 기억난 듯 <<if $monster is 1>>걸어갔다가<<else>>깡충 뛰어가<</if>> 잠시 후 다시 당신에게 다가온다.
	<<bird_hunt_return>>
<<else>>
	<<link [[다음|Bird Tower]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
	<br>
<</if>>

:: Bird Tower Passout No Syndrome Trauma
<<setTowerTemp>><<effects>>
<<beasttype>>【이가】 바로 당신 앞에 섰을 때, 당신은 최악의 상황에 대비한다. 잠시 동안, <<bhe>>【은는】 그저 당신을 쳐다보기만 한다. 긴장감은 상황을 더욱 악화시킬 뿐이다. 영원처럼 느껴지는 시간이 흐른 후, <<bhe>>【은는】 마침내 당신에게 손을 뻗는다.
<br><br>

<<bhe>>【이가】 한 일이라곤 <<bhis>>
<<if $monster is 1>>
	손으로 당신의 뺨을 부드럽게 어루만진 것뿐이라 당신은 놀란다. "<<Wife>>, 누가 널 그렇게 아프게 했나?" <<bhe>>【이가】 묻는다. <<if understandsBirdBehaviour()>>당신은 <<bhe>>【이가】 정말 걱정하고 있다는 것을 알 수 있다. <</if>>"아무도 <<wife>>【을를】 해치지 못하게 할 거야, 내가 여기서 <<wife>>【을를】 행복하게 해줄게." <<bhe>>【이가】 선언한다. <<beasttype>>【은는】 <<bhis>> 날개로 당신을 감싸고 <<bhis>> 손을 당신의 머리카락으로 옮긴다. <<bHe>>【은는】 <<bhis>> 손가락으로 머리를 빗기 시작한다. <<bhis>> 손길이 매우 편안하게 느껴진다.
<<else>>
	부리로. <<bHe>>【은는】 부드럽게 지저귀기 시작한다. <<if understandsBirdBehaviour()>><<bHe>>【은는】 당신을 위로하려는 것이 틀림없다. <</if>><<bhis>> 지저귐은 기분 좋을 정도로 딱 알맞은 크기다. <<beasttype>>【은는】 <<bhis>> 날개로 당신을 감싸고 <<bhis>> 부리로 당신의 머리카락을 훑기 시작한다. <<bhis>> 섬세한 쪼는 느낌이 매우 편안하게 느껴진다.
<</if>>
<<stress -6>><<trauma -6>><<bird_stockholm 3>><<lstress>><<ltrauma>><<ggbirdstockholm>>
<br><br>

당신은 여전히 움직일 수 없어서, <<beasttype>>【이가】 한동안 당신을 계속 위로할 수 있게 된다.
<<if $bird.syndrome gte 15 and $syndromebird isnot 1>>
	<<bhis>> 손길이 초마다 점점 더 기분 좋게 느껴지기 시작한다. 생각 없이, 당신은 <<bhis>>
	<<if $monster is 1>>
		손에 머리를 밀어붙이기 시작한다. "기분이 좀 나아졌나, <<wife>>?" <<bhe>>【이가】 묻는다. 당신은 대답으로 <<bhim>>에게 작은 미소를 지어 보인다. 당신은 결국 <<bhe>>【이가】 몇 분 동안 당신의 머리를 쓰다듬게 내버려 둔다.
	<<else>>
		부리에. <<bHe>>【은는】 사랑스럽게 당신을 쳐다본다. 당신은 새로운 감사함으로 <<bhim>>【을를】 돌아본다. 당신은 결국 <<bhe>>【이가】 몇 분 동안 당신의 머리를 다듬게 내버려 둔다.
	<</if>>

	<<bhe>>【이가】 당신의 머리카락을 계속 어루만지는 동안, 당신은 <<bhe>>【이가】 당신에게 얼마나 친절했는지 생각한다. <<bHe>>【은는】 다른 모든 사람들과 다르다. <<bHe>>【은는】 당신을 아낀다. <<bHe>>【은는】 당신을 안전하게 지켜줄 것이다. 당신은 마침내 <<bhim>>【을를】 이해하는 것 같다.
	<span class="red">이건 <<bhis>> 잘못이 아니야. <<bHe>>【은는】 그저 짝을 원할 뿐이야.
	<br>
	스톡홀름 증후군: 거대 매 특성을 얻었습니다.</span>
	<br><br>
	<<loveInterestAdd "Great Hawk">>
	<<set $syndromebird to 1>>
	<<unset $birdescaped>>
	<<run delete $bird.syndrome>>
	<<specialClothesUnlock "set" "bird">>
<<else>>
	당신은 강요된 애정에 대해 상반된 감정을 느낀다. 마침내 자신을 통제할 수 있게 되었을 때, 당신은 <<beasttype>>【을를】 밀쳐낸다. <<bHe>>【은는】 둥지 반대편으로 비틀거린다.
	<<if $monster is 1>>
		"<<Wife>>【은는】 이제 혼자 있고 싶어하는군, 알겠어." <<bhe>>【이가】 말한다.
	<<else>>
		<<bHe>>【은는】 부드럽게 지저귄다.
	<</if>>
	당신은 일어나서 둥지 밖으로 나가려고 한다. <<beasttype>>【은는】 당신을 막지 않는다.
<</if>>
<br><br>

<<if $bird.state is "hunting" and $bird.timer lte 0>>
	<<bHe>>【은는】 무언가 기억난 듯 <<if $monster is 1>>걸어갔다가<<else>>깡충 뛰어가<</if>> 잠시 후 다시 당신에게 다가온다.
	<<bird_hunt_return>>
<<else>>
	<<link [[다음|Bird Tower]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
	<br>
<</if>>

:: Bird Tower Passout Syndrome
<<setTowerTemp>><<effects>>
<<if $phase is 0>>
	당신은 일어나서 <<bhim>>【을를】 껴안는다.
	<<if $speech_attitude is "meek">>"그렇게 신경 써줘서 고마워. 하지만 난 괜찮아." 당신은 말한다.
	<<elseif $speech_attitude is "bratty">>"그렇게 걱정 안 해도 돼, 바보야." 당신은 말한다.
	<<else>>"나 정말 괜찮아. 그래도 확인해줘서 고마워." 당신은 말한다.
	<</if>>
	<br><br>

	<<beasttype>>【은는】 
	<<if $monster is 1>>
		당신의 포옹에 화답하고 당신과 함께 둥지에 앉는다. "<<wife>>【이가】 괜찮아 보여서 다행이야." <<bhe>>【이가】 말한다.
	<<else>>
		당신에게 몸을 비빈다. <<bHe>>【은는】 즐겁게 꽥꽥거리며 당신과 함께 둥지에 앉는다.
	<</if>>
	당신은 당신의 <<if $monster is 1>><<nnpc_wife "Great Hawk">><<else>>파트너<</if>>【을를】 안고 둥지에서 휴식을 취하며 소중한 순간을 보낸다.
	<br><br>

	잠시 후, 당신은 다시 일어선다. 거대 매는 멈추기를 꺼려하지만, 당신을 보내준다.
	<<if $monster is 1>>
		"<<wife>> 기분이 나아졌으면 좋겠네." <<bhe>>【이가】 말한다.
	<<else>>
		<<bHe>>【은는】 한 번 더 지저귄다.
	<</if>>
	당신은 <<bhim>>에게 미소 짓고, 둥지 밖으로 나선다.
<<else>>
	<<if $speech_attitude is "meek">>"나-나는 괜찮아, 정말이야." 당신은 일어서며 말한다.
	<<elseif $speech_attitude is "bratty">>"이미 말했잖아, 난 괜찮다고." 당신은 일어서며 말한다.
	<<else>>"난 괜찮아." 당신은 일어서며 말한다.
	<</if>>
	<br><br>
	<<if $monster is 1>>
		"정말이야?" <<bhe>> 다시 묻는다. 당신은 대답을 반복한다. <<bHe>>【은는】 그 대답에 만족하지 않는 듯한 목소리다.
	<<else>>
		<<bHe>>【은는】 당신의 대답에 만족하지 않는 듯 보인다.
	<</if>>
	<<bHe>>【이가】 당신에 대한 안달을 멈추지만, <<bhe>>【은는】 여전히 다소 걱정스러워 보인다. 당신은 둥지 밖으로 나선다.
<</if>>
<br><br>

<<if $bird.state is "hunting" and $bird.timer lte 0>>
	<<bHe>>【은는】 무언가 기억난 듯 <<if $monster is 1>>걸어갔다가<<else>>깡충 뛰어가<</if>> 잠시 후 다시 당신에게 다가온다.
	<<bird_hunt_return>>
<<else>>
	<<link [[다음|Bird Tower]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
	<br>
<</if>>

:: Bird Tower Estate
<<setTowerTemp>><<effects>>

<<npc "Great Hawk">>
<<if $monster is 1>>
	<<beasttype>>【은는】 <<bhe>>【이가】 듣는 동안 북쪽을 응시한다.
	<<if $bird.hunts.estate is "complete">>
		"또?" <<bhe>>【이가】 묻는다. 당신은 이번에는 들어갈 방법만 필요하다고 설명한다. "위험해. 하지만 도와줄게." <<bHe>>【은는】 더 가까이 다가와 당신의 이마에 키스한다.
	<<else>>
		"나는 그곳을 피해." <<bhe>>【이가】 말한다. "위험해. 땅에 묶인 지도자가 거기서 둥지를 틀고 있어. 하지만 도와줄게." <<bHe>>【은는】 더 가까이 다가와 당신의 이마에 키스한다.
	<</if>>
	<br><br>

	<<bhis>> 날개가 활짝 펴진다. "돌아오는 길에 선물을 찾아올게." <<bHe>>【은는】 횃대에서 날아오른다.
	<br><br>
<<else>>
	<<beasttype>>【은는】 <<bhe>>【이가】 듣는 동안, 혹은 듣는 것처럼 보이는 동안 북쪽을 응시한다. <<bhis>> 날개가 활짝 펴지고, <<bhe>>【은는】 탑에서 날아오른다. 당신은 <<bhe>>【이가】 이해했는지 확신할 수 없다.
	<br><br>
<</if>>

<<set $bird.timer to random(120, 150)>>
<<set $bird.state to "hunting">>
<<set $estate_fence to "bird">>
<<set $bird.estateKnown to true>>

<<link [[다음|Bird Tower]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>

:: Bird Tower Search
<<setTowerTemp>><<effects>>

당신은 탈출에 도움이 될 만한 것을 찾기 위해 나무와 잔해를 뒤진다.
<<if $bird.clean lte 5>>
	탑은 더럽고, 당신이 뒤지는 바람에 먼지와 파편이 일어난다. 당신은 기침한다. <<stress 6>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
<</if>>

<<if $rng gte 66>>
	<<wearProp "rag">>
	찢어졌지만 튼튼한 천 조각을 발견했다. 밧줄로 쓸 수 있을 것 같다. <<set $bird.materials.fabric += 1>><<gfabric>>
<<else>>
	아무것도 찾지 못했다.
<</if>>
<br><br>

<<link [[다음|Bird Tower]]>><</link>>
<br>

:: Bird Tower Base Descend
<<effects>>

당신은 어둠 속으로 내려가면서 한 걸음 한 걸음 확인한다.
<br><br>

바닥에 도착했다. 벽에 밖으로 이어지는 틈이 있다. 비집고 나갈 수 있을 것 같지만, 반대편에는 약간의 낙차가 있다.
<br><br>

<<link [[다음|Bird Tower Base]]>><</link>>
<br>

:: Bird Tower Base Climb
<<effects>>

당신은 발을 안정적으로 유지하고 몸을 벽에 바싹 붙인 채 돌계단을 오른다.
<br><br>

열린 트랩도어를 통해 나온다.
<br><br>

<<link [[다음|Bird Tower]]>><</link>>
<br>

:: Bird Tower Base
<<effects>>

당신은 황야 깊숙한 곳에 있는 폐허가 된 탑의 기저부에 있다. 벽에는 밖으로 이어지는 틈이 있고, 위로 올라가는 계단이 있다.
<br><br>

<<if $bird.upgrades.mirror isnot 1>>
	<<if $bird.mirror_unknown is 1>>
		방 한가운데에 먼지 덮인 천으로 덮인 거울이 서 있다.
		<br><br>
		<<birdicon "mirror">><<link [[거울을 위층으로 옮긴다 (0:15)|Bird Tower Base Carry]]>><<set $bird.upgrades.mirror to 1>><<bird_pass 15>><<tiredness 3>><</link>>
		<br>
	<<else>>
		방 한가운데에 먼지 덮인 천으로 덮인 키 큰 가구가 서 있다.
		<br><br>
		<<investigateicon>><<link [[가구를 조사한다|Bird Tower Base Mirror]]>><<set $bird.mirror_unknown to 1>><</link>>
		<br>
	<</if>>
<</if>>

<<stairsicon "up">><<link [[계단을 오른다 (0:05)|Bird Tower Base Climb]]>><<bird_pass 5>><</link>>
<br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[탑을 나간다|Bird Tower Base Leave]]>><</link>>
<br>

:: Bird Tower Base Mirror
<<effects>>

천을 들어 올리자 서 있는 거울이 드러난다. 희미한 빛 속에서 당신의 모습을 알아볼 수 있다. 아직 깨지지 않았다.
<br><br>

<<link [[위층으로 옮긴다 (0:15)|Bird Tower Base Carry]]>><<set $bird.upgrades.mirror to 1>><<bird_pass 15>><<tiredness 3>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[그냥 둔다|Bird Tower Base]]>><</link>>
<br>

:: Bird Tower Base Carry
<<effects>>
<<earnFeat "High Reflection">>
당신은 한 걸음 한 걸음 조심하며 거울을 탑 위로 옮기고, 때때로 땅에 내려놓고 쉰다. 가파른 오르막이지만, 당신은 꼭대기에 도착한다.
<br><br>

둥지 맞은편에 새 가구를 놓을 좋은 자리를 찾는다.
<br><br>

<<link [[다음|Bird Tower]]>><</link>>
<br>

:: Bird Tower Base Leave
<<effects>>

당신은 틈새를 비집고 나와 밖의 땅으로 굴러떨어진다. 당신은 성 안뜰에 있다.
<br><br>

<<link [[다음|Castle]]>><</link>>
<br>

:: Bird Tower Look
<<effects>>

가장자리 너머를 엿보자 바람이 머리카락을 낚아챈다. 아주 먼 길이다.
<br><br>

당신은 <span class="gold"><<number $bird.materials.fabric>></span><<birdicon "fabric">> 개의 천 조각을 가지고 있습니다.
<<if $syndromebird isnot 1>>
	<<set _naked to setup.clothingLayer.all.find(c => V.worn[c].name !== "naked")>>
	<<if _naked>>
		옷을 찢어서 더 만들 수 있습니다.
	<<else>>
		옷을 입고 있었다면 찢어서 천으로 만들 수 있을 겁니다.
	<</if>>
<</if>>
<br>

<<if $syndromebird isnot 1>>
	<<if setup.clothes_all_slots.some(slot => $worn[slot].name !== "naked")>>
		다음 옷 찢기:
		<br>
	<</if>>
	<<if $worn.upper.name isnot "naked" and $worn.upper.cursed isnot 1>>
		<<clothingicon $worn.upper "upper">><<link [[$worn.upper.name.toUpperFirst()|Bird Tower Rope Clothes]]>><<set $bird.materials.fabric += 1>><<set $fabricColour to $worn.upper.colour>><<upperruined>><</link>>
		<br>
	<</if>>
	<<if $worn.lower.name isnot "naked" and $worn.lower.cursed isnot 1>>
		<<clothingicon $worn.lower "lower">><<link [[$worn.lower.name.toUpperFirst()|Bird Tower Rope Clothes]]>><<set $fabricColour to $worn.lower.colour>><<set $bird.materials.fabric += 1>><<lowerruined>><</link>>
		<br>
	<</if>>
	<<if $worn.under_upper.name isnot "naked" and $worn.under_upper.cursed isnot 1>>
		<<clothingicon $worn.under_upper "under_upper">><<link [[$worn.under_upper.name.toUpperFirst()|Bird Tower Rope Clothes]]>><<set $fabricColour to $worn.under_upper.colour>><<set $bird.materials.fabric += 1>><<underupperruined>><</link>>
		<br>
	<</if>>
	<<if $worn.under_lower.name isnot "naked" and $worn.under_lower.cursed isnot 1>>
		<<clothingicon $worn.under_lower "under_lower">><<link [[$worn.under_lower.name.toUpperFirst()|Bird Tower Rope Clothes]]>><<set $fabricColour to $worn.under_lower.colour>><<set $bird.materials.fabric += 1>><<underlowerruined undefined "commando">><</link>>
		<br>
	<</if>>
	<<if $worn.over_upper.name isnot "naked" and $worn.over_upper.cursed isnot 1>>
		<<clothingicon $worn.over_upper "over_upper">><<link [[$worn.over_upper.name.toUpperFirst()|Bird Tower Rope Clothes]]>><<set $fabricColour to $worn.over_upper.colour>><<set $bird.materials.fabric += 1>><<overupperruined>><</link>>
		<br>
	<</if>>
	<<if $worn.over_lower.name isnot "naked" and $worn.over_lower.cursed isnot 1>>
		<<clothingicon $worn.over_lower "over_lower">><<link [[$worn.over_lower.name.toUpperFirst()|Bird Tower Rope Clothes]]>><<set $fabricColour to $worn.over_lower.colour>><<set $bird.materials.fabric += 1>><<overlowerruined>><</link>>
		<br>
	<</if>>
	<<if $worn.over_head.name isnot "naked" and $worn.over_head.cursed isnot 1>>
		<<clothingicon $worn.over_head "over_head">><<link [[$worn.over_head.name.toUpperFirst()|Bird Tower Rope Clothes]]>><<set $bird.materials.fabric += 1>><<set $fabricColour to $worn.over_head.colour>><<overheadruined>><</link>>
		<br>
	<</if>>
	<<if $worn.head.name isnot "naked" and $worn.head.cursed isnot 1>>
		<<clothingicon $worn.head "head">><<link [[$worn.head.name.toUpperFirst()|Bird Tower Rope Clothes]]>><<set $bird.materials.fabric += 1>><<set $fabricColour to $worn.head.colour>><<headruined>><</link>>
		<br>
	<</if>>
	<<if $worn.face.name isnot "naked" and $worn.face.cursed isnot 1>>
		<<clothingicon $worn.face "face">><<link [[$worn.face.name.toUpperFirst()|Bird Tower Rope Clothes]]>><<set $bird.materials.fabric += 1>><<set $fabricColour to $worn.face.colour>><<faceruined>><</link>>
		<br>
	<</if>>
	<<if $worn.neck.name isnot "naked" and $worn.neck.cursed isnot 1>>
		<<clothingicon $worn.neck "neck">><<link [[$worn.neck.name.toUpperFirst()|Bird Tower Rope Clothes]]>><<set $bird.materials.fabric += 1>><<set $fabricColour to $worn.neck.colour>><<neckruined>><</link>>
		<br>
	<</if>>
	<<if $worn.hands.name isnot "naked" and $worn.hands.cursed isnot 1>>
		<<clothingicon $worn.hands "hands">><<link [[$worn.hands.name.toUpperFirst()|Bird Tower Rope Clothes]]>><<set $bird.materials.fabric += 1>><<set $fabricColour to $worn.hands.colour>><<handsruined>><</link>>
		<br>
	<</if>>
	<<if $worn.handheld.name isnot "naked" and $worn.handheld.cursed isnot 1>>
		<<clothingicon $worn.handheld "handheld">><<link [[$worn.handheld.name.toUpperFirst()|Bird Tower Rope Clothes]]>><<set $bird.materials.fabric += 1>><<set $fabricColour to $worn.handheld.colour>><<handheldruined>><</link>>
		<br>
	<</if>>
	<<if $worn.legs.name isnot "naked" and $worn.legs.cursed isnot 1>>
		<<clothingicon $worn.legs "legs">><<link [[$worn.legs.name.toUpperFirst()|Bird Tower Rope Clothes]]>><<set $bird.materials.fabric += 1>><<set $fabricColour to $worn.legs.colour>><<legsruined>><</link>>
		<br>
	<</if>>
	<<if $worn.feet.name isnot "naked" and $worn.feet.cursed isnot 1>>
		<<clothingicon $worn.feet "feet">><<link [[$worn.feet.name.toUpperFirst()|Bird Tower Rope Clothes]]>><<set $bird.materials.fabric += 1>><<set $fabricColour to $worn.feet.colour>><<feetruined>><</link>>
		<br>
	<</if>>
		<br>
<</if>>

<<if $harpy gte 6>>
	<!-- Redirects the player to the Perch, where flight can happen. Moved everything to widgets.twee in the "bird_fly_options" widget.-->
	더 나은 도약 지점이 있다면 바람을 타고 멀리 갈 수 있을 겁니다. <span class="blue">횃대가 완벽할지도 모릅니다.</span>
	<br><br>
<<elseif $angel gte 6 or $demon gte 6 or $fallenangel gte 2>>
	<<if $pain gte 21>>
		날개가 당신을 아래로 데려다줄 테지만, <span class="purple">지금 당장 그런 위험한 점프를 하기에는 너무 다쳤습니다.</span>
	<<else>>
		더 나은 도약 지점이 있다면 날개가 당신을 아래로 데려다줄 것입니다. <span class="blue">횃대가 완벽할지도 모릅니다.</span>
	<</if>>
	<br><br>
<</if>>
<<if $bird.rope lt 7>>
	<<if $bird.materials.fabric gte 1>>
		<<if $bird.rope is 0>>
			<<link [[밧줄 만들기 (0:30)|Bird Tower Rope]]>><<set $bird.materials.fabric -= 1>><<set $bird.rope += 1>><<bird_pass 30>><</link>>
			<br>
		<<else>>
			<<link [[밧줄 만들기 (0:30)|Bird Tower Rope Add]]>><<set $bird.materials.fabric -= 1>><<bird_pass 30>><<set $bird.rope += 1>><</link>>
			<br>
		<</if>>
	<<else>>
		<span class="grey">밧줄을 만들려면 천이 더 필요합니다.</span>
		<br>

	<</if>>
<<else>>
	<<link [[탈출 (0:05)|Bird Tower Rope Escape]]>><<bird_pass 5>><</link>>
	<br>
<</if>>
<<link [[물러선다|Bird Tower]]>><</link>>
<br>

:: Bird Tower Rope Clothes
<<effects>>
<<set $fabricColour to [0, "custom"].includes($fabricColour) ? "white" : $fabricColour>>
<<wearProp "rag" $fabricColour>>

당신은 옷을 찢어, 작업에 쓸 재료를 더 확보한다.
<<if $exposed gte 1>>
	산들바람에 몸이 떨린다.
<</if>>
<<covered>>
<br><br>

<<link [[다음|Bird Tower Look]]>><<run delete $fabricColour>><</link>>
<br>

:: Bird Tower Rope
<<effects>>
<<wearProp "fabric rope" "white">>

천과 다른 재료들을 찢고 묶어 밧줄의 시작 부분을 만든다. 아래로 내려가려면 재료가 더 필요할 것이다.
<br><br>

<<link [[다음|Bird Tower]]>><</link>>
<br>

:: Bird Tower Rope Add
<<effects>><<wearProp "fabric rope" "white">>

천과 다른 재료들을 찢고 묶어 밧줄에 덧댄다.
<<if $bird.rope gte 7>>
	<span class="green">바닥까지 닿을 것 같다.</span>
<<elseif $bird.rope gte 6>>
	<span class="teal">거의 다 됐다.</span>
<<elseif $bird.rope gte 4>>
	<span class="lblue">절반 정도는 내려갈 수 있을 것이다.</span>
<<else>>
	<span class="blue">아직 한참 멀었다.</span>
<</if>>
<br><br>

<<link [[다음|Bird Tower]]>><</link>>
<br>

:: Bird Tower Rope Escape
<<effects>><<wearProp "fabric rope climb">>

밧줄 한쪽 끝을 위로 솟은 돌덩이에 묶고, 다른 쪽 끝을 가장자리 너머로 던진다. 바닥에 거의 닿는다. 이 정도면 충분하다.
<br><br>

<<if $syndromebird isnot 1>>
	<<set $bird.rope to 1>>
	<<set $birdescaped = ($birdescaped || 0) + 1>>
<</if>>

<<if $bird.state is "home" and $syndromebird isnot 1>>
	<<npc "Great Hawk">>
	<<beasttype>>【을를】 힐끗 본다. <<bHe>>【은는】 신경 쓰지 않고 있다. 당신은 밧줄을 양손으로 잡고 몸을 돌려 탑 벽을 따라 조심스럽게 내려간다.
	<br><br>
	마지막 몇 피트를 남기고 뛰어내려, 성 안뜰에 착지한다.

	<<if $bird.activity isnot "sleep">>
		<<set $moor_hunt to 9>>

		<span class="red"> 끔찍한 비명이 들린다.</span> <<beasttype>>【이가】 당신의 탈출을 알아차리는 데는 오래 걸리지 않았다.
	<<elseif $bird.activity is "sleep" and $rng lte 70>>
		<<set $moor_hunt to 9>>

		<span class="red"> 끔찍한 비명이 들린다.</span> <<beasttype>>【이가】 당신의 탈출을 알아차리는 데는 오래 걸리지 않았다.
	<</if>>
	<br><br>
<<else>>
	밧줄을 양손으로 잡고 몸을 돌려 탑 벽을 따라 조심스럽게 내려간다. 마지막 몇 피트를 남기고 뛰어내려, 성 안뜰에 착지한다.
	<br><br>
<</if>>
<<link [[다음|Castle]]>><<endevent>><<set $moor to 100>><</link>>
<br>

:: Bird Tower Glide Attempt
<<effects>>
가장자리로 더 가까이 걸어가기 시작한다. 이 높이에서 보는 광경에 감탄하지 않을 수 없다.
<<if $willpowerSuccess>>
	<<set $birdGlide to 1>>
	<span class="green">뱃속이 울렁거림에도 불구하고 계속 나아간다.</span><<gwillpower>><<willpower 1>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[활강하여 내려간다|Bird Tower Glide]]>><<endevent>><</link>><<flight_text>>
<<else>>
	<<set $daily.glideScared to true>>
	<span class="red">당신은 멈춰 서서, 공포에 질려 가장자리에서 물러난다.</span> 너무 가까이 가는 것은 좋지 않은 생각인 것 같다.
	<br>
<</if>>
<br>
<<link [[물러선다|Bird Tower Perch]]>><<endevent>><</link>>

:: Bird Tower Glide
<<effects>>
<<if $bird.activity is "sing" and $bird.state is "home">>
	<<npc "Great Hawk">>
	<<if $monster is 1>>
		"부디 곧 돌아와 주시오, <<wife>>." 당신이 횃대 가장자리로 다가가자 <<bhe>>【이가】 말한다. "사랑하오."
	<<else>>
		<<bHe>>【은는】 당신이 횃대 가장자리로 다가가자 곧 돌아오라며 울음소리를 낸다.
	<</if>>
	<<endevent>>
<</if>>
당신은 뛰어내린다. 몇 피트 정도 떨어지자 바람이 당신을 붙잡는다. 당신은 부드럽게 아래로 떠내려가, 폐허가 된 안뜰에 착지한다.
<br><br>

<<if $bird.state is "home" and $syndromebird isnot 1>>
	<<set $birdescaped = ($birdescaped || 0) + 1>>
	<<npc "Great Hawk">>
	<span class="red">끔찍한 비명이 들린다.</span> <<beasttype>>【이가】 당신의 비행을 알아차리는 데는 오래 걸리지 않았다.
	<br><br>
	<<set $moor_hunt to 9>>
	<<endevent>>
<</if>>
<<link [[다음|Castle]]>><<set $moor to 100>><</link>>
<br>

:: Bird Tower Glide 2
<<effects>>
<<if ($bird.activity is "sing" or $bird.activity is "groom") and $bird.state is "home">>
	<<npc "Great Hawk">>
	<<if $monster is 1>>
		<<if playerIsPregnant() and playerBellySize() gte 12>>
			"이렇게 취약한 상태인데 <<wife>>【이가】 떠나야만 하오?" <<bHe>>【은는】 당신의 <<bellyDescription>>【을를】 걱정스럽게 쳐다본다. "부디 무사히 돌아오시오." 당신이 횃대 가장자리로 다가가자 <<bhe>>【이가】 말한다. "사랑하오."
		<<else>>
			<<if Weather.precipitation is "rain">>"성난 하늘을 조심하시오<<else>>"부디 곧 돌아와 주시오<</if>>, <<wife>>." 당신이 횃대 가장자리로 다가가자 <<bhe>>【이가】 말한다. "사랑하오."
		<</if>>
	<<else>>
		<<bHe>>【은는】 당신이 횃대 가장자리로 다가가자 곧 돌아오라며 울음소리를 낸다.
	<</if>>
	<<endevent>>
<</if>>
당신은 탑에서 뛰어내려 바람에 몸을 맡긴다. 당신은 폐허가 된 안뜰로 급강하한다.
<br><br>

<<link [[다음|Castle]]>><<set $moor to 100>><</link>>
<br>

:: Bird Tower Farmlands
<<effects>><<flight_effects>>
<<if ($bird.activity is "sing" or $bird.activity is "groom") and $bird.state is "home">>
	<<npc "Great Hawk">>
	<<if $monster is 1>>
		<<if Weather.precipitation is "rain">>"성난 하늘을 조심하시오<<else>>"부디 곧 돌아와 주시오<</if>>, <<wife>>." 당신이 횃대 가장자리로 다가가자 <<bhe>>【이가】 말한다. "사랑하오."
	<<else>>
		<<bHe>>【은는】 당신이 횃대 가장자리로 다가가자 곧 돌아오라며 울음소리를 낸다.
	<</if>>
	<<endevent>>
<</if>>
당신은 탑에서 뛰어내린다. 강한 기류가 당신을 붙잡고, 활강하기 시작한다. 바람이 당신을 황야 위로 실어 나른다. 하늘을 날아오르는 동안 혼자만의 생각에 잠길 수 있는 시간이 주어진다.
<br><br>

바람이 대부분의 일을 해주지만, 농장에 도착할 때쯤에는 날개가 지친다. <<physique 1>><<athletics 2>>
<br><br>
<<unset $moor_hunt>>
<<link [[다음|Farmland]]>><<set $moor to 0>><</link>>
<br>

